                <ul>
                    <li>Planning guidance led by Mary Isern</li>
                    <li>Clearer decisions, timelines and vendor direction</li>
                    <li>A separate coordinator can be assigned for the event day</li>
                    <li>More realistic support for how South Florida events actually move</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="mt-4">
                    <a href="https://maryisern.com/" target="_blank" class="vnv-btn btn-gold-vnv">Visit MaryIsern.com</a>
